WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.600
You need 3 or 4 fresh pea pods from the grocery store, an apple, a sweet bell

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.140
pepper, a ruler, and leaves from one plant.

3
00:00:10.983 --> 00:00:13.443
Open each pod and line the peas up on a plate.

4
00:00:14.003 --> 00:00:15.603
Measure each pea across with a ruler.

5
00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:18.723
An adult cuts the apple and pepper so the seeds show.

6
00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:21.323
Later, look at pictures of animal families.

7
00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:24.657
Peas from one pod are alike, but not identical.

8
00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:28.317
Look for the biggest, the smallest, and any with a different shade.

9
00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.367
Stay with your child.

10
00:00:30.807 --> 00:00:32.207
An adult does all the cutting.

11
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.000
Keep peas and seeds away from children under four.
